h":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":77,"original_start_line":89,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":78,"original_line":78,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1826430020,"original_position":90,"position":78,"subject_type":"line"},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/pulls/21551","id":2069286785,"node_id":"PR_kwDOABZIoc57Vs-B","html_url":"https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/21551","diff_url":"https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/21551.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/21551.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/issues/21551","number":21551,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"MAINT: interpolate: trim down `_bspl` extension","user":{"login":"ev-br","id":2133832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzM4MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2133832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br","html_url":"https://github.com/ev-br","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ev-br/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a work-in-progress attempt at trimming down the binary size of scipy.interpolate. Previously, https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/21539 and https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/21223 managed to shave off some 160kb by removing fused memoryview types from a Cython extension and moving things off Cython to pure python.  

This PR aims to see the effect of ditching Cython completely and replacing it with a manually written C extension. 
It is a little too early to conclusively assess the full effects on the binary size: there are three heavy functions left in the Cython `_bspl` extension.
It might be good time though to start assessing the downsides on clarity and maintainability: Cython's much more expressive and less error-prone than a manual C extension. Or maybe it's just me being used to Cython :-).

The design here is trying to separate the workhorse routines (`interpolate/src/__fitpack.{h,cc}`) and python-facing wrappers (`interpolate/src/_dierckxmodule.cc`). This way, computational routines know nothing about python, and the glue does not do any computations other than parsing python arguments, doing sanity checking, and sending inputs to computational routines. I'm also keeping all memory allocations in the glue layer. 

So at this stage, I'd appreciate any comments about the C API --- does the general picture make sense? is the code readable? does it look maintainable? I'm sure there are multiple problems and bugs, too.","created_at":"2024-09-12T18:11:03Z","updated_at":"2024-11-02T11:26:56Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1f7b584d3cd21441310a4f2ce3bfb3181611440e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":37342579,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzM0MjU3OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/labels/scipy.interpolate","name":"scipy.interpolate","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""},{"id":108549863,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDg1NDk4NjM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/labels/maintenance","name":"maintenance","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Items related to regular maintenance tasks"},{"id":1898683324,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxODk4NjgzMzI0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/labels/C/C++","name":"C/C++","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"Items related to the internal C/C++ code base"},{"id":1898683832,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxODk4NjgzODMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/labels/Cython","name":"Cython","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"Issues with the internal Cython code base"},{"id":3694181847,"node_id":"LA_kwDOABZIoc7cML3X","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/labels/Meson","name":"Meson","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"Items related to the introduction of Meson as the new build system for SciPy"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/pulls/21551/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/pulls/21551/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scipy/scipy/issues/21551/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.githu